*.pyc

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
docs/service_key.txt

# Supabase CLI local temp
supabase/.temp/

# Agent scratch — throwaway tool output, never a deliverable.
# Dated handoff/deliverable folders are deliberately NOT ignored.
_bughunt_tmp/

# Installed agent skills (owner 2026-09-04) — tooling, not app source. The
# `skills` CLI manages these; re-add with `npx skills add …`. `.claude/skills`
# only (launch.json / settings.json stay tracked).
.agents/
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json

# Local image-source folders whose contents are ALREADY in the Supabase
# `course-cards` storage bucket (owner 2026-09-17). The app resolves this art
# by slug from that bucket (screens/awards/CredentialThumb.tsx credentialArtUrl),
# never from the app bundle — so these are your local originals, not repo
# assets. Kept on disk, ignored by git. Verified redundant: credential-squares
# 102/102, Program_Squares 36/36, and the pen rescue copy 102/102 all present
# in the bucket.
assets/credential-squares/
assets/Program_Squares/
save here before pen erases it!/
